"<p>Migrate seamlessly from Supabase Cloud to your own infrastructure without dumping SQL manually.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Obtain your Supabase Cloud project connection string and service role key.</li>\n<li>Add your project under <strong>Settings -> Cloud Connections</strong>.</li>\n<li>Go to <strong>Apps -> New App -> Import from Supabase Cloud</strong>.</li>\n<li>Nitrobase connects via session pooler with TLS verification, clones schemas, migrates storage buckets, and launches your self-hosted instance.</li>\n</ol>"